---
title: PayLink - Payment State Diagram
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Initiated

    Initiated --> FundsHeld: Validation passes and funds are held
    Initiated --> Rejected: Validation fails

    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller: Send payment to biller

    SentToBiller --> Completed: Success confirmed
    SentToBiller --> Failed: Failure confirmed
    SentToBiller --> Unknown: No response within 10 seconds
    SentToBiller --> Unknown: No final callback within 5 minutes after accepted

    Unknown --> Completed: Success confirmed
    Unknown --> Failed: Refusal confirmed or reconciliation proves non-receipt

    Failed --> Refunded: Release held total to funding wallet

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Unknown
        Funds remain held.
        Timeout alone does not trigger a refund.
    end note